        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Timothy Zahn\n- Products: Vision of the Future, Hand of Thrawn novels, Thrawn trilogy, Heir to the Empire trilogy, Survivor's Quest, Quadrail\n- Topics: Star Wars novels, science fiction novels, fictional transport systems\n\nFacts:\n- Timothy Zahn wrote the best-selling science fiction series the Thrawn trilogy, which is also known as the Heir to the Empire trilogy.\n- Vision of the Future is the second of the two Hand of Thrawn novels by Timothy Zahn, and those novels follow the Thrawn trilogy.\n- Timothy Zahn's 1998 Star Wars novel Vision of the Future was followed by the sequel Survivor's Quest.\n- The Quadrail is a fictional intra-galactic rail system conceived by science fiction author Timothy Zahn.",
